{"excerpt_id":"ex_d02146dfcea5_004","source_id":"src_d02146dfcea5","source_hash":"05a1727494d21181b9e20fe814644f0f105df2d1aebbb9a408e361f43a7a171d","text":".. rst-class:: classref-introduction-group","location_hint":"paragraph 7","char_start":452,"char_end":494,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T04:11:34.958Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_d02146dfcea5_005","source_id":"src_d02146dfcea5","source_hash":"05a1727494d21181b9e20fe814644f0f105df2d1aebbb9a408e361f43a7a171d","text":"This helper class can be used to store :ref:`Variant<class_Variant>` values on the filesystem using INI-style formatting. The stored values are identified by a section and a key:","location_hint":"paragraph 9","char_start":521,"char_end":699,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T04:11:34.958Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_d02146dfcea5_006","source_id":"src_d02146dfcea5","source_hash":"05a1727494d21181b9e20fe814644f0f105df2d1aebbb9a408e361f43a7a171d","text":"[section]\n some_key=42\n string_example=\"Hello World3D!\"\n a_vector=Vector3(1, 0, 2)","location_hint":"paragraph 11","char_start":718,"char_end":800,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T04:11:34.958Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_d02146dfcea5_007","source_id":"src_d02146dfcea5","source_hash":"05a1727494d21181b9e20fe814644f0f105df2d1aebbb9a408e361f43a7a171d","text":"The stored data can be saved to or parsed from a file, though ConfigFile objects can also be used directly without accessing the filesystem.","location_hint":"paragraph 12","char_start":802,"char_end":942,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T04:11:34.958Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_d02146dfcea5_008","source_id":"src_d02146dfcea5","source_hash":"05a1727494d21181b9e20fe814644f0f105df2d1aebbb9a408e361f43a7a171d","text":"The following example shows how to create a simple **ConfigFile** and save it on disc:","location_hint":"paragraph 13","char_start":944,"char_end":1030,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T04:11:34.958Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_d02146dfcea5_009","source_id":"src_d02146dfcea5","source_hash":"05a1727494d21181b9e20fe814644f0f105df2d1aebbb9a408e361f43a7a171d","text":"# Create new ConfigFile object.\n var config = ConfigFile.new()","location_hint":"paragraph 16","char_start":1069,"char_end":1131,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T04:11:34.958Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_d02146dfcea5_010","source_id":"src_d02146dfcea5","source_hash":"05a1727494d21181b9e20fe814644f0f105df2d1aebbb9a408e361f43a7a171d","text":"# Store some values.\n config.set_value(\"Player1\", \"player_name\", \"Steve\")\n config.set_value(\"Player1\", \"best_score\", 10)\n config.set_value(\"Player2\", \"player_name\", \"V3geta\")\n config.set_value(\"Player2\", \"best_score\", 9001)","location_hint":"paragraph 17","char_start":1134,"char_end":1357,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T04:11:34.958Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_d02146dfcea5_011","source_id":"src_d02146dfcea5","source_hash":"05a1727494d21181b9e20fe814644f0f105df2d1aebbb9a408e361f43a7a171d","text":"# Save it to a file (overwrite if already exists).\n config.save(\"user://scores.cfg\")","location_hint":"paragraph 18","char_start":1360,"char_end":1444,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T04:11:34.958Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_d02146dfcea5_012","source_id":"src_d02146dfcea5","source_hash":"05a1727494d21181b9e20fe814644f0f105df2d1aebbb9a408e361f43a7a171d","text":"// Create new ConfigFile object.\n var config = new ConfigFile();","location_hint":"paragraph 20","char_start":1470,"char_end":1534,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T04:11:34.958Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_d02146dfcea5_013","source_id":"src_d02146dfcea5","source_hash":"05a1727494d21181b9e20fe814644f0f105df2d1aebbb9a408e361f43a7a171d","text":"// Store some values.\n config.SetValue(\"Player1\", \"player_name\", \"Steve\");\n config.SetValue(\"Player1\", \"best_score\", 10);\n config.SetValue(\"Player2\", \"player_name\", \"V3geta\");\n config.SetValue(\"Player2\", \"best_score\", 9001);","location_hint":"paragraph 21","char_start":1537,"char_end":1761,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T04:11:34.958Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_d02146dfcea5_014","source_id":"src_d02146dfcea5","source_hash":"05a1727494d21181b9e20fe814644f0f105df2d1aebbb9a408e361f43a7a171d","text":"// Save it to a file (overwrite if already exists).\n config.Save(\"user://scores.cfg\");","location_hint":"paragraph 22","char_start":1764,"char_end":1850,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T04:11:34.958Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_d02146dfcea5_015","source_id":"src_d02146dfcea5","source_hash":"05a1727494d21181b9e20fe814644f0f105df2d1aebbb9a408e361f43a7a171d","text":"This example shows how the above file could be loaded:","location_hint":"paragraph 23","char_start":1852,"char_end":1906,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T04:11:34.958Z"}
